<title>SWEDEN: SIBIA sets licencing deal with Meiji Seika.</title>
<headline>SIBIA sets licencing deal with Meiji Seika.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Swedish owner of the U.S. SIBIA Neurosciences Inc said on Tuesday that SIBIA has signed a licencing agreement with Japan's Meiji Seika Kaisha Ltd for a treatment for Parkinson's Disease.</p>
<p>Skandigen said in a statement released in Stockholm that the agreement relating to SIB-1508Y covered Japan, China and other Asian countries.</p>
</text>
